                                <p>The Job upload the package ${no_spark_package_info.file_name} to the S3: bucket [kyligencecloud-ci]</p>
                                <p>It saved in the path of [/packages/ke-without-spark/], please check it and use! Tks!</p>"""
                            )
                        }
                    }
                }
                stage('4.3.Deploy SNAPSHOT Jar') {
                    when {
                        expression {
                            return params.envStage in ['QA', 'RC']
                        }
                    }
                    steps {
                        container('build') {
                            script {
                                dir('sourcecode') {
                                    sh """
                                        cat /root/.m2/settings.xml
                                        mvn versions:set -DnewVersion="${version}-SNAPSHOT"
                                        mvn deploy -Pdev -DskipTests -T 4C
                                    """
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                    post {
                        success {
                            sendNotify('EMAIL',
                                "[KE4][SNAPSHOT JAR] SUCCESSFUL to Upload the Jar to the product library [repo-ofs]'",
